a569c5d6_Signature%20white%20pink%20dots.png 2288w\" class=\"image-15\"/></a><nav role=\"navigation\" class=\"nav-menu-2 w-nav-menu\"><a href=\"#hero-section\" class=\"nav-link w-nav-link\">Home</a><a href=\"#services-section\" class=\"nav-link w-nav-link\">Services</a><a href=\"#products-section\" class=\"nav-link w-nav-link\">Products</a><a href=\"#publishers-section\" class=\"nav-link w-nav-link\">Publishers</a><a href=\"#advertisers-section\" class=\"nav-link w-nav-link\">Advertisers</a><a href=\"#about-section\" class=\"nav-link w-nav-link\">About us</a></nav><a href=\"#contact-section\" class=\"nav-link cta secondary w-nav-link\">Contact us</a><div class=\"menu-button-2 w-nav-button\"><div class=\"icon w-icon-nav-menu\"></div></div></div></div><section id=\"hero-section\" class=\"sections hero-section\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container-main container-hero w-container\"><h1 data-w-id=\"5ba7b59e-0cfe-f157-f31c-7a5d7fbf83f0\" style=\"opacity:0;-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 16px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 16px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 16px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 16px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0)\" class=\"big-heading\">Unleashing Worldwide Digital Ads Potential</h1><p data-w-id=\"169db5a2-b7c7-0402-8d43-bbf6a86b9be3\" style=\"opacity:0;-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 16px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 16px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 16px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 16px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0)\" class=\"hero-paragraph\">PinkLion’s publishing house for CTV, Mobile and Desktop media. <br/>We bring together exceptional brands with top-tier publishers</p><a data-w-id=\"b094588f-237d-f5bd-bf5d-afb57104cbaa\" style=\"-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 16px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 16px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 16px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 16px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0\" href=\"#contact-section\" class=\"main-button w-button\">Contact  us</a><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/6675bc06e86a73dd15bcd6d7_platforms.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1307\" alt=\"\" class=\"image-11\"/></div></section><section id=\"services-section\" class=\"sections services-section\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container-main w-container\"><h2 class=\"services-heading\">Our services</h2><p class=\"services-paragraph\">A power sales house for publishers - endless opportunities for advertisers</p><div class=\"w-layout-grid grid-card\"><div class=\"card\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/6617fb7c5106b75e5f1f6985_multi%20icon.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"76\" alt=\"\" class=\"image-10\"/><div class=\"card-text\"><h4 class=\"card-heading\">multi-channel monetization</h4><p class=\"card-paragraph\">We&#x27;re focused on monetizing multiple traffic channels by matching advertisers with ideal ad placements, boosting fill rates per request across platforms.</p></div></div><div class=\"card\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/6614f4b11e569a6643ec5966_streamline_target.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"76\" alt=\"\" class=\"image-10\"/><div class=\"card-text\"><h4 class=\"card-heading\"><strong class=\"card-heading\">Data-Driven Insights</strong></h4><p class=\"card-paragraph\">Leverage comprehensive data for strategic targeting decisions. Our innovative marketing solutions result in cutting-edge strategies for publishers.</p></div></div><div class=\"card\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/6617f75acb2db1919e2af041_flowbite_link-outline.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"76\" alt=\"\" class=\"image-10\"/><div class=\"card-text\"><h4 class=\"card-heading\">All Integrations Fully Supported</h4><p class=\"card-paragraph\">We support unlimited Header Bidding and QPS, oRTB Endpoint &amp; Tag-based supply integrations. As you scale up with us there are no surprises.</p></div></div><div class=\"card\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/6618003fabf7b73b1fcebfa1_innovation%20icon.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"76\" alt=\"\" class=\"image-10\"/><div class=\"card-text\"><h4 class=\"card-heading\">Innovative Management tools</h4><p class=\"card-paragraph\">We grant partners access to the PinkLion platform, ensuring transparency and control. We enable independent campaign management while providing dedicated human support.</p></div></div><div class=\"card\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/6675a2ee618b5aa0fceb6d09_image%3DDiamond.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"76\" alt=\"\" class=\"image-10\"/><div class=\"card-text\"><h4 class=\"card-heading\"><strong class=\"card-heading\">Premium Brand Partnerships</strong></h4><p class=\"card-paragraph\">Collaborate with top-tier brands to deliver exceptional results &amp; boost the performance &amp; prestige of your ad spaces.</p></div></div><div class=\"card\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/661806fed1969b6794844202_partnership%20icon.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"76\" alt=\"\" class=\"image-10\"/><div class=\"card-text\"><h4 class=\"card-heading\">Stability and Long-Lasting Alliances</h4><p class=\"card-paragraph\">It’s not enough to occasionally hit the KPIs. We tirelessly collaborate with partners for mutual satisfaction, treating excellence not just as a gig but as a carefully executed routine.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"products-section\" class=\"sections products-section\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container-main w-container\"><h2 class=\"services-heading\">Our products </h2><p class=\"services-paragraph\">Our unique tools for sites &amp; apps</p><div class=\"w-layout-grid grid-products\"><div class=\"card\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/667934234a415f5dc9ffd69f_player%20image.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"654\" height=\"Auto\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/667934234a415f5dc9ffd69f_player%20image-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/667934234a415f5dc9ffd69f_player%20image-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/667934234a415f5dc9ffd69f_player%20image-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/667934234a415f5dc9ffd69f_player%20image.png 1308w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 654px\" class=\"image-10\"/><div class=\"card-text\"><h4 class=\"card-heading\">Audio podcast Player tool</h4><p class=\"card-paragraph\">A service that turns text into lifelike podcasts, allowing you to create longer engagements between your content and your users.</p></div></div><div class=\"card\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/667934b702cd433542c41768_quizzes.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"654\" height=\"Auto\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/667934b702cd433542c41768_quizzes-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/667934b702cd433542c41768_quizzes-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/667934b702cd433542c41768_quizzes-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/667934b702cd433542c41768_quizzes.png 1308w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 654px\" class=\"image-10\"/><div class=\"card-text\"><h4 class=\"card-heading\">Engagement Boosting Tool</h4><p class=\"card-paragraph\">Quizzes and Polls, Story and Custom engagements, Branded story strip, Videos engagements, Personality tests.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"publishers-section\" class=\"sections publishers-section\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container-main container-publishers w-container\"><div id=\"w-node-fdf131a5-1fde-cc89-7c5f-2ce7192fe93c-274c450b\" class=\"advertise-div\"><h4 class=\"advertise-heading-4\">Publishers</h4><h2 class=\"publisher-heading\">Why Monetize with Us?</h2><p class=\"publisher-paragraph\">Thousands of premium &amp; exclusive advertisers choose to advertise with us around the clock. Collaborate with us to gain access to the hottest campaigns in the market.</p><h3 class=\"publisher-heading-3\">Our edge</h3><div class=\"media-div\"><div id=\"w-node-fdf131a5-1fde-cc89-7c5f-2ce7192fe946-274c450b\" class=\"edge-card\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/6612d98953a4d930adf69011_maximizing%20icon.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"Auto\" alt=\"\" class=\"image-5\"/><div class=\"edges-heading\">Maximizing<br/>fill-rate</div></div><div class=\"edge-card\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/6612d95c084bd646557a72dc_exclusive%20icon.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" alt=\"\" class=\"image-14\"/><div class=\"edges-heading\">Exclusive brand demand</div></div><div class=\"edge-card\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/6612d95b3238584c4ad0e05d_support%20icon.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" alt=\"\" class=\"image-13\"/><div class=\"edges-heading\">24/7 dedicated support</div></div></div></div><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/667934233f009016cc6b05a2_publishers%20image.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"288.5\" id=\"w-node-fdf131a5-1fde-cc89-7c5f-2ce7192fe952-274c450b\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/667934233f009016cc6b05a2_publishers%20image-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/667934233f009016cc6b05a2_publishers%20image-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/667934233f009016cc6b05a2_publishers%20image-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/667934233f009016cc6b05a2_publishers%20image-p-1600.png 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/667934233f009016cc6b05a2_publishers%20image.png 1731w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 288.5px\" class=\"image-publishers\"/></div></section><section id=\"advertisers-section\" class=\"sections advertisers-section\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container-main container-advertise w-container\"><div id=\"w-node-_69961517-0eb8-84b2-6ef8-739452908ad0-274c450b\" class=\"advertise-div\"><h4 class=\"advertise-heading-4\">Advertisers</h4><h2 class=\"advertise-heading\">Why Advertise with Us?</h2><p class=\"advertise-paragraph\">Our cross-screens international reach grants the world’s advertisers exposure to the relevant audiences with their brands targeted precisely and accurately. We offer each client a tailor-made campaign setting &amp; performance according to their specific needs &amp; targets. Our people and technology work hand-in-hand to ensure the best results.</p><h3 class=\"advertise-heading-3\">Our rich media reach</h3><div class=\"media-div\"><div id=\"w-node-_3f835456-4c56-1367-729c-d3863066f2be-274c450b\" class=\"media-card\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/660e68c450ba1c1a0b130e50_quill_tv.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" alt=\"\" class=\"image-4\"/><div class=\"media-heading\">Connected TV</div></div><div class=\"media-card\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/6614ed1a7c4fb7a48898c382_quill_phone.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" alt=\"\"/><div class=\"media-heading\">Mobile in-app</div></div><div class=\"media-card\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/660e68c41fe460b59d4b01b2_quill_desktop.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" alt=\"\" class=\"image-12\"/><div class=\"media-heading\">Desktop</div></div></div><h3 class=\"advertise-heading-3 quality-control\">Quality Control </h3><div class=\"div-block-10\"><div class=\"quality-check-card\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/667814d22a9911b275ea322a_v%20icon.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\"/><div class=\"media-heading quality-heading\">IVT Scan</div></div><div class=\"quality-check-card\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/667814d22a9911b275ea322a_v%20icon.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\"/><div class=\"media-heading quality-heading\">AI Optimisations</div></div><div class=\"quality-check-card\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/667814d22a9911b275ea322a_v%20icon.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\"/><div class=\"media-heading quality-heading\">Human Factor</div></div></div></div><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/6679325f0c1b1b743d868061_advertise%20image%203.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"340\" id=\"w-node-_49877cc6-3956-dc9a-23ea-97d91772ee20-274c450b\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/6679325f0c1b1b743d868061_advertise%20image%203-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/6679325f0c1b1b743d868061_advertise%20image%203-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/6679325f0c1b1b743d868061_advertise%20image%203-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/6679325f0c1b1b743d868061_advertise%20image%203-p-1600.png 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/6679325f0c1b1b743d868061_advertise%20image%203-p-2000.png 2000w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60d58b4f90072e4d034c4508/6679325f0c1b1b743d868061_advertise%20image%203.png 2352w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 340px\" class=\"image-advertisers\"/></div></section><section id=\"about-section\" class=\"sections\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container-main container-about w-container\"><h2 id=\"w-node-d592a6ed-f1cc-0bba-5ba4-a65daecb9efd-274c450b\" class=\"advertise-heading about-heading\">A bit about our executive team</h2><div id=\"w-node-ae97ba16-4629-84c0-41e1-16101f148181-274c450b\"><p class=\"advertise-paragraph about-paragraph\">PinkLion Digital was founded by an elite squad of programmatic experts with over 20 years of mutual ad monetization experience, and a track record of exceptional success. PLD offers monetization solutions with cutting-edge technology alongside our top-notch service. Focusing on data-driven growth for businesses, marketers benefit extensively from our proven results. Our proprietary programmatic solution followed by our extensive industry knowledge drives outstanding performance.</p></div></div></section><section id=\"contact-section\" class=\"sections publishers-section contact-section\"><div class=\"container-main contact-container\"><div class=\"max-width-large align-center\"><div class=\"margin-bottom-2 margin-small\"><h2 class=\"heading-7\">Contact us</h2></div><p class=\"text-size-medium\">Lets discover innovative ways to elevate and optimize your monetization strategies together, paving the way for new opportunities and growth!</p><a href=\"https://forms.monday.com/forms/2476fbce652419af124c00d6d9c81f46?r=euc1\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"main-button secondary w-button\">new publisher application form</a></div></div></section><div class=\"w-layout-grid footer\"><a id=\"w-node-_8fc3ad32-9c51-6b2b-5e71-6c736152bc0a-6152bc09\" href=\"#\" class=\"brand-2 brand-footer w-nav-bra